WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:08.000
Speaker 1: Well, it's been a long, tough road
for the delusional, unhinged Trump fraud lawyer

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.470
Sidney Powell.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:12.750
But it does seem as though her story has peaked.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:13.750
And now we are.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.530
We're really in the denouement.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:21.279
As I like to say, this might be the last piece
of the story, as Sidney Powell has now reportedly

00:00:21.279 --> 00:00:25.619
been banned from all of Donald Trump's properties.

00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:29.909
Recall that she's been a beleaguered attorney
for a while now.

00:00:29.909 --> 00:00:33.780
Early on in the 2020 voter fraud lies, she
was very involved.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:39.149
She appeared at that mind-blowing press conference
where Rudy Giuliani's hair dye melted all

00:00:39.149 --> 00:00:40.620
over his face.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:47.821
And that's the one where she made the wild
claims about Hugo Chavez and Tifa Cuba, some

00:00:47.821 --> 00:00:50.859
guy named Eric Coomer and many others.

00:00:50.859 --> 00:00:55.600
At some point, Sidney Powell clearly was working
with Donald Trump.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.739
But soon after that outrageous press conference,
the Trump campaign put out a statement saying

00:00:59.739 --> 00:01:04.629
Sidney Powell is working on her own, trying
to create distance because what she did was

00:01:04.629 --> 00:01:05.770
so humiliating.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.630
But then she showed up at the Oval Office,
so it really wasn't clear what was taking

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.630
place.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:12.520
Well, now she's been totally disgraced.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:16.090
We've covered some of the really embarrassing
interviews that she gave in the last few months.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:21.700
Her cohort, Rudy Giuliani, has been sanctioned
by various bar associations.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:25.430
Trump has seemingly abandoned both Giuliani
and Sidney Powell.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:31.079
But now, to add insult to injury, Powell is
reportedly on Trump's so-called no go list

00:01:31.079 --> 00:01:32.700
at his properties.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:38.440
The Daily Beast reports that quote Since he
left office in January, certain advisers and

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:42.870
longtime associates to Trump have kept an
informal short list of people who they should

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:47.740
look out for, including at Trump's private
clubs or offices in Florida, New Jersey and

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:48.740
New York.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:54.420
The point of this roster is to intercept and
possibly rebuff attempted outreach visits

00:01:54.420 --> 00:02:00.450
or phone calls from a handful of conservative
figures who could bring the ex-president more

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:03.429
undesired headaches.

00:02:03.429 --> 00:02:13.760
This is expanded on further in a Daily Beast
article, which says, What does it say?

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:17.420
Sydney is very much on the no go list.

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:24.450
Her problems right now do not need to be the
former president's problems.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:27.880
Powells legal exposure right now is, of course,
massive.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.900
And ever since she tried to work with Trump
to orchestrate a coup last year against Joe

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:38.110
Biden, feelings of frustration and bitterness
have lingered between Trump and Powell.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:44.690
What that means is, in the end, Trump will
turn on you in this case without you even

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:46.610
diminishing your support for him.

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:52.720
We know that if you go from 110 percent supportive
of Trump to 99 percent supportive, Trump often

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:54.140
turns on you anyway.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:58.830
In this case, Sidney Powell seems to have
maintained her loyalty through and through.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.940
She still is repeating all the same stuff.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:05.000
But here it seems to be because she's so wacky
that Donald Trump is kind of backing off a

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.000
little bit.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:13.980
I would imagine that Sidney Powell thought
she was going to get massive rewards and access

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:18.860
and fame and power for spreading the election
lies about Trump and doing the press conferences

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:19.910
and the like.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:25.420
She did get fame, in a sense, for being completely
whacked out and disconnected from reality.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:29.330
But we know what Trump does when people are
no longer useful to him, they might be no

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.750
longer useful to him because they've turned
on him.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.110
People like Michael Cohen.

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:37.110
They might be no longer useful to him because
they don't have any more money and the election

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.690
is over like his supporters.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:41.070
So he just tries to fleece them out of their
last pennies.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.710
He doesn't care.

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:47.010
And they might not be useful to him because
like Sidney Powell, they've just been ridiculed

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:51.630
and made fools of so much in the media that
they can't do anything for him anymore anymore.

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:55.570
And think about Sidney Powell, who would hire
her now for actual legal work.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:04:02.170
I wouldn't hire her for, you know, a real
estate closing, never mind something like

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:06.730
what she was trying to do for Donald Trump
or anything in between, quite frankly.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:10.120
So not going well for Sidney Powell.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.040
Banned from Trump properties.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.451
Not going well for Rudy Giuliani.

00:04:13.451 --> 00:04:14.451
And what?

00:04:14.451 --> 00:04:15.990
There are lessons here.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.769
And one of the big, big lessons seems to be.

00:04:19.769 --> 00:04:23.770
Donald Trump will turn on you no matter how
close.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:26.580
No matter how much he seems to like you, he
will turn on you.

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:31.759
And even now there are reports we don't we
don't know to what degree they're true.

00:04:31.759 --> 00:04:38.000
There are reports that the relationship between
Trump and Ivanka, as well as Jared Kushner,

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:43.379
have started to deteriorate because Ivanka
seems to think some of the stuff Trump has

00:04:43.379 --> 00:04:47.569
done over the last few months continuing to
push the voter fraud lies is just making him

00:04:47.569 --> 00:04:50.409
look bad, which of course it is with much
of the world.

00:04:50.409 --> 00:04:52.879
But his own supporters absolutely love him
for it.

00:04:52.879 --> 00:04:54.340
So that's the latest.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:58.430
Drew, if you invested in Rudy's stock, you
would be down right now.

00:04:58.430 --> 00:06:15.190
If you invested in Sidney Powell stock, you
would be down even more.

